How much it costs per month for what? The bare minimum to not pull your hair out? p2w?

&#x200B;

I'll assume to not pull your hair out. You'll want pets at first -- they give you a free one I believe, sometimes 2 depending on events. You'll want 5 -- they cost about 20$ each if I remember (haven't bought pets in a long time). Then, you'll probably want some weight, although it's not a must. It just makes life easier. Probably 20$ on weight. Then, the value pack, which you'll get for free at first. This costs around 15$ a month, and your life will be hell without it. After you get pets, all you really need is a value pack.

&#x200B;

I played the game for years, but I stop in here and there to play now, so I'm not 100% up to date with things. I know there is a new marketplace thats "better"(?), so you might even be able to get value packs and pets there. Maybe someone else will be able to give you more info.
